1
00:00:00,135 --> 00:00:01,953
Type: “Design a fish that can fly.”

2
00:00:02,274 --> 00:00:03,571
That’s the promise of a biological

3
00:00:03,571 --> 00:00:05,845
compiler: describe the capability you want,

4
00:00:05,920 --> 00:00:07,388
then engineer across scales.

5
00:00:07,904 --> 00:00:10,323
Delphi Bio and MorphoSwarm Studio bring a

6
00:00:10,323 --> 00:00:12,282
decentralized swarm of agents to the challenge.

7
00:00:12,462 --> 00:00:15,542
They apply mathematical biology, propose simulations,

8
00:00:15,723 --> 00:00:18,663
