16
00:00:32,176 --> 00:00:32,872
Then think bigger.

17
00:00:33,053 --> 00:00:34,871
How would a school coordinate takeoff?

18
00:00:34,981 --> 00:00:36,449
What changes for predators,

19
00:00:36,524 --> 00:00:37,536
