26
00:00:49,163 --> 00:00:51,858
Compatible models become composable building blocks,

27
00:00:51,898 --> 00:00:53,996
with biophysical control knobs to explore.

28
00:00:54,338 --> 00:00:55,490
Explore protein motion.

29
00:00:55,530 --> 00:00:56,857
Compare cell signals.

30
00:00:56,932 --> 00:00:58,160
Bend a virtual fin

31
00:00:58,160 --> 00:00:59,101
