38
00:01:12,623 --> 00:01:14,586
New findings update claims

39
00:01:14,586 --> 00:01:16,229
and flag dependent designs.

40
00:01:16,375 --> 00:01:17,672
This is the infrastructure we’re

41
00:01:17,672 --> 00:01:19,069
